Vnum            12412
Name            裂魄終界座~
Description
終界座像整段終界井腹最後一塊仍勉強聚得住輪廓的終魄石座，腳下環界只剩一圈隨時會再淡盡一層的細薄紋，所有殘痕都在這裡被拖往更深的裂魄絕界。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        12411
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        12501
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         終界座~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深處~
End

End
